		(descr "JILN JL212R-35003B01 (LCSC C2962951) push-in PCB terminal block, 3 poles, 3.5 mm pitch, wire entry parallel to the PCB, release buttons on the wire face. Same size and hole pattern: Degson DG212R-THR-3.5-03P (C7603454); both follow Phoenix SPT 1,5/3-H-3,5. Two pins per pole, rows 7.0 mm apart, 1.2 mm holes. Body 11.2 x 12.3 x 8.5 mm; buttons 1.5 mm proud of the wire face. From the JILN and Degson drawings. Legends: 1 + (string in), 2 NEXT (to next port), 3 END (string return).")
